{
  "doc": {
    "title": "Negative Revisions",
    "date": "2025-08-04",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "version": "v1",
    "source_file": "250804 - Negative Revisions.docx"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_74740ea292f9"
      },
      "title": null,
      "credit": null,
      "credit_tokens": null,
      "group_id": "grp_0001",
      "group_seq": 1,
      "group_len": 1,
      "layout": "column"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "漲多終將回調。在經歷了一段「只漲不跌」的行情後，風險資產在全面低於預期的非農就業數據打擊下走低。整體就業數據疲軟（失業率由 4.117% 升至 4.248%），再次印證了就業市場放緩的趨勢，此外，美國勞工統計局也發布了近年來（除疫情期間外）最大規模的兩個月就業數據下修（-25.8 萬）。"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_ac79747eaa30"
      },
      "title": "近年來最大規模的兩個月就業數據下修（除疫情期間外）令市場措手不及",
      "credit": null,
      "credit_tokens": null,
      "group_id": "grp_0002",
      "group_seq": 1,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_8ec9cb9ae6e9"
      },
      "title": null,
      "credit": "Bloomberg",
      "credit_tokens": [
        "Bloomberg"
      ],
      "group_id": "grp_0002",
      "group_seq": 2,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "雪上加霜的是，ISM 製造業就業指數跌至 2020 年第二季度以來的最低水平，而其他領先指標也預示著就業市場恐將進一步惡化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_03a293910220"
      },
      "title": "多項領先指標顯示就業市場仍有下行壓力",
      "credit": null,
      "credit_tokens": null,
      "group_id": "grp_0003",
      "group_seq": 1,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_d4ca6e3b06c4"
      },
      "title": null,
      "credit": "Bloomberg",
      "credit_tokens": [
        "Bloomberg"
      ],
      "group_id": "grp_0003",
      "group_seq": 2,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "市場反應迅速且劇烈，美國股市收盤下跌 2% 至 3%，美元兌日圓下跌 2.2% 至 147，而對比前一日，利率市場定價所反映的年底前降息預期幾乎增加了 25 個基點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "收益率變化特別顯著，2 年期收益率當日崩跌近 30 個基點，是近五年來最大單日跌幅之一。上週結束時，市場對今年降息預期升至約 60 個基點，而前一天僅為 35 個基點左右，這促使 Trump 總統猛烈抨擊美聯儲主席 Powell 未能及時降息，並批評美國勞工統計局公布「不準確」的就業數據。"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_b5faf10ceb72"
      },
      "title": "2 年期收益率遭遇近年來最大單日跌幅之一",
      "credit": null,
      "credit_tokens": null,
      "group_id": "grp_0004",
      "group_seq": 1,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_b6a9fd5b0797"
      },
      "title": null,
      "credit": "Bloomberg",
      "credit_tokens": [
        "Bloomberg"
      ],
      "group_id": "grp_0004",
      "group_seq": 2,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_916b04850d01"
      },
      "title": "利率市場定價反映年底前 60 個基點左右的降息預期",
      "credit": null,
      "credit_tokens": null,
      "group_id": "grp_0005",
      "group_seq": 1,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_f8dc418031b4"
      },
      "title": null,
      "credit": "Bloomberg",
      "credit_tokens": [
        "Bloomberg"
      ],
      "group_id": "grp_0005",
      "group_seq": 2,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“ 我們需要準確的就業數據 …… 現在的數據是 Biden 政府任命的人做的。 ” “ 在我看來，現在的就業數據是被操縱過的，目的就是為了讓共和黨和我丟臉。 ” -- Trump 總統"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_308defa20ceb"
      },
      "title": null,
      "credit": null,
      "credit_tokens": null,
      "group_id": "grp_0006",
      "group_seq": 1,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_9531c10ca8b1"
      },
      "title": null,
      "credit": "Truth Social, WSJ, Bloomberg",
      "credit_tokens": [
        "Truth Social",
        "WSJ",
        "Bloomberg"
      ],
      "group_id": "grp_0006",
      "group_seq": 2,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "上週五市場的劇烈反應也蓋過了近期美聯儲偏鷹派的會議內容。會中 Powell 強調，美聯儲已在盡力透過維持利率不變以應對商品通脹。同時，隨著美聯儲理事 Kugler 辭職，Trump 總統可能在短期內提名新的人選，對美聯儲的施壓只會進一步升高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_1e4a81f54c2d"
      },
      "title": "美聯儲在最新一次會議上承認商品通脹壓力正在上升",
      "credit": "Fortune",
      "credit_tokens": [
        "Fortune"
      ],
      "group_id": "grp_0007",
      "group_seq": 1,
      "group_len": 1,
      "layout": "column"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "談到政策影響，Trump 總統也再次延後實施新一輪關稅，從原定的 8 月 1 日延後至 8 月 7 日，為本週的密集談判鋪路。談判焦點將放在瑞士（關稅高達 39%）、台灣、加拿大和巴西，同時市場也將持續關注俄烏局勢升溫，以及美國部署潛艦的後續發展。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "儘管外界對關稅談判存在各種意見和嘲諷，但美國 7 月份收入確實達到創紀錄的 1500 億美元，前一個月也實現了 270 億美元的盈餘，大幅扭轉了一年前 710 億美元的赤字。此外，隨著美國例外論敘事回歸，市場對美國資產的需求自 5 月以來大幅反彈，任何資本外流的擔憂都已煙消雲散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "美元亦順勢反彈，美元指數從近期低點回升超過 3%，黃金等避險資產則開始轉弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_ede3812c7482"
      },
      "title": "隨著關稅收入增加，美國財政收支在近幾個月大幅改善",
      "credit": null,
      "credit_tokens": null,
      "group_id": "grp_0008",
      "group_seq": 1,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "column"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_aaea9d097d0b"
      },
      "title": null,
      "credit": "ABC News, CNBC",
      "credit_tokens": [
        "ABC News",
        "CNBC"
      ],
      "group_id": "grp_0008",
      "group_seq": 2,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "column"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_231d13bda64a"
      },
      "title": "資本大規模回流美國市場，美元大幅反彈",
      "credit": null,
      "credit_tokens": null,
      "group_id": "grp_0009",
      "group_seq": 1,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_f061deb8628d"
      },
      "title": null,
      "credit": "Spectra Markets",
      "credit_tokens": [
        "Spectra Markets"
      ],
      "group_id": "grp_0009",
      "group_seq": 2,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "股市方面，財報季迄今表現不俗，Visa、Mastercard 和 Amex 均報告了支付量和消費動能的穩健增長，而銀行的財報也大致符合預期。科技板塊方面，消費者在商品和運輸領域持續展現韌性，Meta 和 Microsoft 盈利表現出色，但最終被 Amazon 和 Coinbase 令人失望的財報所拖累。"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_ac89c7f55c68"
      },
      "title": "疲乏的股市最終選擇關注 Amazon/Coinbase 不如預期的業績，而非 Meta 和 Microsoft 的強勁表現",
      "credit": "Spectra Markets",
      "credit_tokens": [
        "Spectra Markets"
      ],
      "group_id": "grp_0010",
      "group_seq": 1,
      "group_len": 1,
      "layout": "column"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_2b420a8a286d"
      },
      "title": "股市中散戶投機情緒仍然非常高漲",
      "credit": null,
      "credit_tokens": null,
      "group_id": "grp_0011",
      "group_seq": 1,
      "group_len": 1,
      "layout": "column"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "最後，在加密貨幣方面，Coinbase 營收年增 3.3% 至 15 億美元，但未達分析師預期，且低於 2025 年第一季度的 20 億美元。淨利潤受到加密貨幣和 Circle 持倉未實現收益的提振，不過全球和美國現貨交易量在第二季度整體偏淡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Coinbase 股價已自 7 月高點回落 25%，隨著整體市場情緒走弱，BTC 價格也下跌至 11.2 萬美元，上週五有超過 10 億美元的多頭期貨遭到清算，是 5 月以來最慘烈的一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_8b986c28105e"
      },
      "title": "Coinbase 股價自 7 月高點回落 25%，拖累整體加密貨幣市場情緒走弱",
      "credit": null,
      "credit_tokens": null,
      "group_id": "grp_0012",
      "group_seq": 1,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_5b0997e0456d"
      },
      "title": null,
      "credit": "Bloomberg, Messari",
      "credit_tokens": [
        "Bloomberg",
        "Messari"
      ],
      "group_id": "grp_0012",
      "group_seq": 2,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_180933dec0c2"
      },
      "title": "BTC 多頭期貨清算超過 10 億美元，結束了艱難的一週",
      "credit": "Bloomberg",
      "credit_tokens": [
        "Bloomberg"
      ],
      "group_id": "grp_0013",
      "group_seq": 1,
      "group_len": 1,
      "layout": "column"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "不出所料，BTC 與 ETH 上週均出現顯著資金流出，BTC 在週四/週五出現 10 億美元的流出，為年內單日最差表現之一，而 ETH 也結束了近一個月的連續淨流入，在上週五流出 1.52 億美元。"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_c95dc26a9e58"
      },
      "title": "由於整體市場風險情緒降溫，ETF 在上週五出現顯著的資金流出",
      "credit": null,
      "credit_tokens": null,
      "group_id": "grp_0014",
      "group_seq": 1,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_5e4e9c09229a"
      },
      "title": null,
      "credit": "Farside Investors",
      "credit_tokens": [
        "Farside Investors"
      ],
      "group_id": "grp_0014",
      "group_seq": 2,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "整體而言，鑑於資金外流的速度和規模，市場表現其實已較預期穩定，而這也與 BTC 與 Altcoins 的市場深度明顯提升有關。隨著機構資金與專業投資者加入，次級市場流動性已有改善，避免了 ETF 推出前那種劇烈拋售的情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_3bfc2fb1da76"
      },
      "title": "次級市場流動性的顯著改善，是機構化進程的一個重要指標",
      "credit": null,
      "credit_tokens": null,
      "group_id": "grp_0015",
      "group_seq": 1,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "asset_id": "img_b88b3366afae"
      },
      "title": null,
      "credit": "Kaiko",
      "credit_tokens": [
        "Kaiko"
      ],
      "group_id": "grp_0015",
      "group_seq": 2,
      "group_len": 2,
      "layout": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "展望未來，市場目前處於一個微妙的關口，預期多空雙方將陷入拉鋸，短期內尚難分出勝負。多頭陣營認為市場對非農就業數據過度反應，而空頭則會指出，鑑於過去三個月的過熱行情，這將是市場轉向的初步信號。持續不斷的關稅消息與 Trump 日益激進的言論，勢必進一步加劇市場雜訊，而隨著夏季進入後段，整體交易活動減少，市場波動可能會被進一步放大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "我們預期短期內不會出現明確的方向性突破，本月價格走勢也將較 7 月更為震盪。第四季度將十分關鍵，屆時美聯儲會全面恢復運作，而關稅與通脹的疊加效應也將開始對實體經濟產生影響。在此背景下，我們認為現在是適度降低風險敞口的良機，以迎接忙碌的 9 月和年底。祝各位操作順利，交易愉快！"
    }
  ],
